WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.850
My name is Robert. The track I chose is Data for the Real World.

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.650
The project is called Brain for Cross-border Deal.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:15.850
You have a specific product and want to enter a specific market,

4
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:21.050
but you've never been there and have no time for market research.

5
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.650
To use the platform, you first upload your company information:

6
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.750
your website, decks, or anything else.

7
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:36.250
Then it shows you the channels you can connect,

8
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:43.150
so you can connect Gmail, WhatsApp, or any other channel you use.

9
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.150
After that, it shows you the demand trend.

10
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:52.750
The AI in Deal Brain understands your product and solution,

11
00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:59.850
and shows you deal opportunities in different markets and countries,

12
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:03.850
and how demand is trending in each market.

13
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:11.950
You can just ask: “I want to sell semiconductor chips in Japan. Any suggestions?”

14
00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:17.950
It shows you, for example, 70 potential buyers

15
00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:25.050
as a contact list you can email,

16
00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.750
and the potential demand from those companies.

